SmartSessionLens::isLockTagEnabled
├── when lock tag is not enabled
│   └── it returns false
├── when checking different account
│   └── it returns false
├── when checking different lock tag
│   └── it returns false
├── when checking different permission id
│   └── it returns false
├── when lock tag is enabled
│   └── it returns true
├── when multiple lock tags are enabled for same permission
│   └── it returns true for each
└── when using no lock tag (bytes12(0))
    └── it returns true when enabled